  "A pane that comes back without its program picks up Claude Code's or Codex's conversation again.": "面板恢复时如果原来的程序已不在，就重新接上 Claude Code 或 Codex 的对话。",
  "A pane's program, folder and size, with buttons to float, zoom and close it.": "显示面板的程序、文件夹和大小，以及浮动、放大和关闭按钮。",
  "Background uses the pane's background. Extend carries the edge cells' colors out to the pane's edges.": "“背景”使用面板的背景色；“延伸”把边缘单元格的颜色延伸到面板边缘。",
  "Branches and changes in pane headers and tab rows (Libertty runs git in panes' folders).": "在面板标题栏和标签行中显示分支和改动（Libertty 会在面板所在文件夹运行 git）。",
  "Color a pane's edges with the background a full-screen program such as an editor paints.": "用全屏程序（如编辑器）绘制的背景色填充面板边缘。",
  "Comfortable adds a second line: what the program reports, else its branch and changes, else its folder.": "“宽松”多一行：程序报告的内容，没有就显示分支和改动，再没有就显示文件夹。",
  "File ▸ New Tab in Worktree… (⌥⌘T) makes a branch in a folder of its own.": "文件 ▸ 在工作树中新建标签…（⌥⌘T）会在单独的文件夹里新建一个分支。",
  "Glass takes the theme's color.": "玻璃效果会带上主题的颜色。",
  "History kept per terminal; 10 MB is about 10 000 lines of 120 columns.": "每个终端保留的历史；10 MB 约为 1 万行 120 列的内容。",
  "How many of a tab's programs show as icons on it.": "标签上最多显示几个程序图标。",
  "Installs a Libertty skill and session hooks for Claude Code and Codex.": "为 Claude Code 和 Codex 安装 Libertty 的技能和会话 hook。",
  "Make colors 16–255 from the theme's own; off, they're xterm's standard set.": "用主题自己的颜色生成 16–255 号颜色；关闭时使用 xterm 的标准颜色。",
  "Needs shell integration.": "需要 Shell 集成。",
  "Never tears, but types up to two frames later.": "画面不会撕裂，但输入最多晚两帧显示。",
  "OSC 52: vim, tmux and remote shells use it.": "OSC 52：vim、tmux 和远程 Shell 会用到。",
  "Off by default: anything you copied would be readable.": "默认关闭：否则你拷贝的任何内容都能被读取。",
  "Programming ligatures such as -> != ===.": "编程连字，例如 -> != ===。",
  "Programs can send notifications with OSC 9 or OSC 777, and say when they need you.": "程序可以通过 OSC 9 或 OSC 777 发送通知，并在需要你时告诉你。",
  "Programs keep running when Libertty quits, crashes or updates. Takes effect at the next launch.": "Libertty 退出、崩溃或更新时程序继续运行。下次启动时生效。",
  "Relative to the repository, or a path. Inside it, git is told to ignore them (.git/info/exclude).": "相对于仓库的路径，或一个绝对路径。放在仓库内时，会让 git 忽略它们（.git/info/exclude）。",
  "Run this instead of your login shell (through /bin/sh -c).": "运行此命令代替你的登录 Shell（通过 /bin/sh -c）。",
  "Show this Mac's panes in a browser; every page needs the link's secret.": "在浏览器中显示本机的面板；每个页面都需要链接里的密钥。",
  "Tabs above share the bar's whole width.": "顶部的标签平分整条标签栏的宽度。",
  "Text that reads worse than this against its background is drawn white or black.": "与背景对比度低于此值的文字会改用白色或黑色绘制。",
  "The display still sleeps.": "显示器仍会睡眠。",
  "The icon fills while programs wait for you; its menu goes to them, and opens the Quick Terminal.": "有程序等你处理时图标变为实心；从它的菜单可以跳过去，也可以打开快捷终端。",
  "The pane under the pointer gets the keyboard, without a click.": "指针下的面板直接获得键盘焦点，无需点按。",
  "The panes even out after every split, close and move.": "每次分屏、关闭或移动后自动均分面板。",
  "The tab shows the name an agent gives its task.": "标签显示 Agent 为任务起的名字。",
  "Trackpad scrolling follows your fingers point by point.": "触控板滚动逐点跟随手指。",
  "Where new panes start: inherit (the focused pane's folder), home, or a path.": "新面板的起始位置：inherit（当前面板的文件夹）、home，或一个路径。",
  "Which Option keys act as Alt (Meta) instead of typing accents and symbols.": "哪些 Option 键作为 Alt（Meta），而不是输入重音字符和符号。",
  "Wider or narrower columns, the text's size unchanged.": "加宽或收窄列宽，文字大小不变。",
  "Working, waiting for you or done, from what Codex, Gemini, OpenCode, Amp and other agents show.": "根据 Codex、Gemini、OpenCode、Amp 等 Agent 的屏幕显示判断：工作中、等你处理或已完成。",
  "The interface's language. Takes effect when Libertty restarts.": "界面语言。重启 Libertty 后生效。",
